Trademark and naming note for the Letta project
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository contains no Letta branding assets. Two identifiers inherited from
the upstream protocol are retained because they are wire-protocol and package
identifiers rather than brand assets:

  - the protocol field name `letta_code_version`
  - the npm package `@letta-ai/letta-client`, a build-time dependency

Removing or renaming either would break protocol compatibility.
